all through time, just the mechanisms have changed.  If you are
dumb enough to drink and drive, you increase the chances that you
will be selected out of the gene pool.  If you are dumb enough to
ignore the warnings about cigarettes, you will tend to die too
(although not quickly enough to affect you reproductive fitness
much).  

